
# type(scope): short imperative subject, for example  docs(repo): add branching guide
# types: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build chore revert
# scopes: viewer pipeline data remote tools engine docs repo release
# Keep the subject under about 72 characters and skip the final period.
#
# Then, if it helps, a short paragraph in plain words about why you made the change
# and anything a reviewer should know. Mark breaking changes with ! after the scope
# or a BREAKING CHANGE: line at the end.
#
# Enable it with: git config commit.template .gitmessage
